{
  "kind": "mutation",
  "id": "mut-format-mismatch-video-html-adm",
  "title": "Video-only impression is filled with plain banner HTML instead of VAST",
  "format": "video",
  "protocol": "ortb-2.5",
  "context": "web",
  "dialect": "iab",
  "scenario": "pair",
  "tags": ["mutation", "format-mismatch"],
  "base": "video-web-25-inline-vast2",
  "category": "format-mismatch",
  "specRef": "https://github.com/InteractiveAdvertisingBureau/openrtb2.x/blob/403cbba542de3a5d9cfcccd0a34e74b01b79a9f1/2.6.md#objectvideo",
  "patch": {
    "request": [
      {
        "op": "add",
        "path": "/device/ua",
        "value": "Mozilla/5.0 (Synthetic fixture; audit)"
      },
      {
        "op": "add",
        "path": "/device/ip",
        "value": "192.0.2.11"
      }
    ],
    "response": [
      {
        "op": "replace",
        "path": "/seatbid/0/bid/0/adm",
        "value": "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></head><body><div style=\"width:640px;height:480px;background:#223b62\">NOT A VAST DOCUMENT</div></body></html>"
      },
      {
        "op": "remove",
        "path": "/seatbid/0/bid/0/protocol"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expect": {
    "request": {
      "maxLevel": "warning"
    },
    "response": {
      "maxLevel": "warning"
    },
    "crosscheck": {
      "must": [
        {
          "id": "crosscheck.id_match",
          "path": "id",
          "level": "ok"
        },
        {
          "id": "crosscheck.bid.impid_resolved",
          "path": "seatbid[0].bid[0].impid",
          "level": "ok"
        },
        {
          "id": "crosscheck.bid.above_floor",
          "path": "seatbid[0].bid[0].price",
          "level": "ok"
        },
        {
          "id": "crosscheck.bid.video_not_vast",
          "path": "seatbid[0].bid[0].adm",
          "level": "warn"
        }
      ],
      "mustNot": [
        {
          "id": "crosscheck.bid.video_vast",
          "path": "seatbid[0].bid[0].adm"
        },
        {
          "id": "crosscheck.bid.native_invalid_adm",
          "path": "seatbid[0].bid[0].adm"
        }
      ]
    },
    "http": {
      "status": 200
    },
    "browser": {
      "state": "success"
    }
  },
  "knownGap": null,
  "specNotes": [
    "This case demonstrates a format-mismatch check that already works: crosscheck.js gates its VAST check on imp.video && bid.adm and reports crosscheck.bid.video_not_vast (WARN) whenever the returned adm is not VAST-shaped, independent of anything else in the payload.",
    "device.ua/device.ip are patched in only to keep the request clean of the unrelated optional-Device deviation formerly recorded for this base pair as DEF-100 (resolved by 021 on 2026-09-08: warnings now); this case is scoped to the video/HTML content-type question."
  ]
}
